			<p class="mt-2 leading-loose">feel free to reach out to me.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="mb-10">
			<h2>some links</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<svg class="inline-block h-6 w-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
